<description>&lt;p&gt;U.S. Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth traveled to Caracas and signed a military cooperation agreement with the interim Venezuelan government, expanding joint efforts against drug trafficking and labeling Venezuela a compliant security partner. The United States also launched a Caribbean operation during which a marine died after falling overboard. Meanwhile, former oil minister Machado urged a more drastic overhaul of Venezuela's oil sector. The crisis continues amid hyperinflation, food shortages and massive emigration, with the socioeconomic collapse persisting. Two battle-related deaths occurred in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOM3VlUmtXdkJETU9WcE4tTVZzNGtzMFFxZ05LcG5IX1pwWkdhWjczSmlqUGt2UVpfUWx0SFhsVDJ4Q3pWX3k1Qjk5czZGRUlleEZEbTFkQ1p4QnpMLTc3YkpDVkotUThwbGo0Q3U3dmJlYVJISzBqNmd4Vlo3eWtCTGlZZHNKaWZSendTWkJVcWdSTzcxQjRpNHlVV2haUjA4cFg1U1E5Z2hDdEFnWWVWd1p3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNbTFvUVNXREJTRnJ2VjByU2lNUGdPZnA5c2MzQ1ozME9oVFhmTzc0WnY4M0xKblZiMGxNSkt3SlFHN2diY29lTFhBakd5X0dCUjB2d0VPOVRENUt4YWVHbXk0cmtwdjBhOXlWS3lkc2FDaHpfd0ktZHlRWnZPWkctQVVlVTFVS0llZW5WVlhyWVR4R1dST2hRVjFobVMyUGYtTUY3X0ZQZTBFTXRVQlg5V2tWVkxQZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Monthly Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOUG1qb1J6eDE3OGIyZi1IWFBkMHFlVEZNR3M4ZFNnaS1tcHZnTGo2WU9ZM3F3bklQaDNBQlpqb1ZGUDNzUFFnUGI0V09PcldkTUd2MGItZ0FLbm5MbElrOFNndzJfX1BjekgxdWNqRy0zQ1Y2QzEtN0ZBVU5FaEpPclAtY2NoRGZrTC02U3doWEJneTVjbHZ6dHE2elk0ZkRycTZTbzdxYzRoOWJ5X2wyeA?oc=